# gate3.plan: omega-mv #639 (OMEGA-CRYPTO-REUSE-1) gate 3 adapter rows.
# Runs the owning repositories' own crypto tests (controls) and real source mutants that must
# compile and be killed by the intended assertion. Written for om/tls/test/reuse/aggregate.om.
#
# Checkouts (prepared outside this plan, detached at their pins, clean):
#   build/tls/reuse/src/oh  Open Humanity d929a34d61716a347506fe3e64e2a09a0fddf317 (GitHub main mirror;
#                           Radicle OH main f68d7a2 is an unrelated genesis history, so the GitHub line is used)
#   build/tls/reuse/src/ux  aienux c874c3b737626d8c588c04cfa37019e9dde56964 (rad main; contains L693 pin 25ade075)
#   build/tls/reuse/src/sc  Sovereign Core 314c0cc2360c75fd44edfc55ae22db036e792e96
# Rows carry no flock: the runner itself is expected to run under the pool lock, a nested flock on
# the same lock file would deadlock. Restores use `git apply -R` of the same sha-bound diff.
# In need/pass values `#` matches one run of decimal digits (the panic thread id).

